1.0.0: configurable About button on the main menu

- injects a 20x20 "!" button to the right of Quit, mirroring the language button layout
- tooltip and OK button are localised (zh_cn / en_us)
- rich-text screen with colour codes, scrolling and an OK button
- button position (mirrored by default, or absolute) and all text live in config/mfnabout.cfg
- the icon must be sampled with drawModalRectWithCustomSizedTexture; drawTexturedModalRect
  assumes a 256x256 atlas and read the wrong region of the 16x16 texture
